<view class="{{['sync-page', aD && 'dark-mode', aE && 'tablet-mode']}}"><view class="settings-navbar"><view class="status-bar" style="{{'height:' + a}}"></view><view class="settings-navbar__content"><view class="settings-navbar__left" bindtap="{{c}}"><roc-icon-plus wx:if="{{b}}" u-i="36599afe-0" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{b}}"></roc-icon-plus></view><text class="settings-navbar__title">数据同步与备份</text><view class="settings-navbar__right"></view></view></view><view class="tab-segmented"><view class="{{['tab-segmented__indicator', d && 'tab-segmented__indicator--right']}}"></view><view class="tab-segmented__item" bindtap="{{f}}"><text class="{{['tab-segmented__text', e && 'tab-segmented__text--active']}}">云同步</text></view><view class="tab-segmented__item" bindtap="{{h}}"><text class="{{['tab-segmented__text', g && 'tab-segmented__text--active']}}">本地备份与恢复</text></view></view><scroll-view class="settings-scroll" scroll-y="true"><block wx:if="{{i}}"><view class="sync-intro-card"><view class="sync-intro-card__icon"><roc-icon-plus wx:if="{{j}}" u-i="36599afe-1" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{j}}"></roc-icon-plus></view><text class="sync-intro-card__title">数据同步与备份</text><text class="sync-intro-card__desc">将歌单、播放历史、配置等数据同步到云端实现多设备互通，或备份为本地文件随时恢复。</text></view><view wx:if="{{k}}" class="sync-not-logged"><view class="sync-not-logged__card"><view class="sync-not-logged__icon"><roc-icon-plus wx:if="{{l}}" u-i="36599afe-2" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{l}}"></roc-icon-plus></view><text class="sync-not-logged__text">请先登录账号</text><text class="sync-not-logged__hint">登录后即可使用数据同步功能</text><view class="sync-not-logged__btn" bindtap="{{m}}"><text>去登录</text></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{n}}" class="sync-logged-section"><view class="sync-stats-card"><view class="sync-cell"><text class="{{['sync-cell__value', p]}}">{{o}}</text><text class="sync-cell__label">同步状态</text></view><view class="sync-cell"><text class="sync-cell__value sync-cell__value--time">{{q}}</text><text class="sync-cell__label">最后同步</text><text wx:if="{{r}}" class="sync-cell__meta">{{s}}</text></view><view class="sync-cell"><text class="sync-cell__value">{{t}}/{{v}}</text><text class="sync-cell__label">今日同步(次)</text><text class="sync-cell__meta">自动 {{w}}/{{x}} · 手动 {{y}}/{{z}}</text></view><view class="sync-cell"><text class="sync-cell__value">v{{A}}</text><text class="sync-cell__label">数据版本</text></view><text wx:if="{{B}}" class="sync-cell__hint">上次同步未成功，点「立即同步」重试</text></view><view wx:if="{{C}}" class="admin-collapse-section"><view class="admin-collapse-header" bindtap="{{E}}"><text class="admin-collapse-title">数据概览</text><roc-icon-plus wx:if="{{D}}" u-i="36599afe-3" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{D}}"></roc-icon-plus></view><view wx:if="{{F}}" class="admin-collapse-body"><view class="admin-stats-row"><view class="admin-stat-item"><text class="admin-stat-num">{{G}}</text><text class="admin-stat-label">总用户数</text></view><view class="sync-stat-divider"></view><view class="admin-stat-item"><text class="admin-stat-num">{{H}}</text><text class="admin-stat-label">今日活跃</text></view><view class="sync-stat-divider"></view><view class="admin-stat-item"><text class="admin-stat-num">{{I}}</text><text class="admin-stat-label">今日同步(次)</text></view></view></view></view><view class="{{['sync-action-btn', J && 'sync-action-btn--busy']}}" bindtap="{{K}}"><text>立即同步</text></view><view class="settings-group"><text class="group-title">同步设置</text><view class="settings-list"><view class="settings-item" bindtap="{{O}}"><view class="settings-item__icon"><roc-icon-plus wx:if="{{L}}" u-i="36599afe-4" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{L}}"></roc-icon-plus></view><view class="settings-item__content"><text class="settings-item__title">同步频率</text><text class="settings-item__subtitle">{{M}}</text></view><roc-icon-plus wx:if="{{N}}" u-i="36599afe-5" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{N}}"></roc-icon-plus></view></view></view><view class="sync-help-card"><text class="sync-help-card__title">什么时候会自动同步？</text><text class="sync-help-card__item">· 需要「专属服务器地址」+ 已登录；专属服务器与本机运行模式都可登录云同步，公共服务器模式没有云端。</text><text class="sync-help-card__item">· 改动（歌单／收藏／设置等）不会马上传：等「自动上传」间隔到点后自动传一次（默认 {{P}} 分钟）；切到后台会尽快补传，但两次之间至少隔「切前后台」的时间。</text><text class="sync-help-card__item">· 播放记录不单独触发上传，但每次上传都会连它一起带上；累计播放满 {{Q}} 首（默认）也会整体传一次。</text><text class="sync-help-card__item">· 回到前台或重开 App 时拉取云端，默认 {{R}} 分钟最多拉一次。</text><text class="sync-help-card__item">· 以上间隔都能在「同步频率」里改。</text></view><view class="sync-help-card"><text class="sync-help-card__title">有什么限制？</text><text class="sync-help-card__item">· 每日上限：自动 35 次、手动 15 次，两者分开计算、互不占用。</text><text class="sync-help-card__item">· 自动包含：{{S}} 分钟防抖、退到后台、满 {{T}} 首。</text><text wx:if="{{U}}" class="sync-help-card__item">· 切前后台的即时上传最少间隔 {{V}} 分钟，避免来回切换耗光额度。</text><text class="sync-help-card__item">· 只有上传成功才计 1 次，失败和冲突重传不计。</text><text class="sync-help-card__item">· 额度每天（北京时间 8:00）重置。</text></view></view></block><block wx:if="{{W}}"><view class="sync-intro-card"><view class="sync-intro-card__icon"><roc-icon-plus wx:if="{{X}}" u-i="36599afe-6" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{X}}"></roc-icon-plus></view><text class="sync-intro-card__title">本地备份与恢复</text><text class="sync-intro-card__desc">将歌单和设置备份为 JSON 文件保存到本地，或从本地文件恢复数据。无需网络，适合本地备份。</text></view><view class="settings-group"><text class="group-title">备份数据</text><view class="settings-list"><view wx:if="{{Y}}" class="export-path-hint" bindtap="{{ab}}"><text class="export-path-hint__text">导出位置：{{Z}}</text><text wx:if="{{aa}}" class="export-path-hint__action">点击查看</text></view><view wx:if="{{ac}}" class="export-path-divider"></view><view class="settings-item" bindtap="{{af}}"><view class="settings-item__icon"><roc-icon-plus wx:if="{{ad}}" u-i="36599afe-7" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{ad}}"></roc-icon-plus></view><view class="settings-item__content"><text class="settings-item__title">备份歌单</text><text class="settings-item__subtitle">备份为 .json 文件</text></view><roc-icon-plus wx:if="{{ae}}" u-i="36599afe-8" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{ae}}"></roc-icon-plus></view><view class="settings-item" bindtap="{{ai}}"><view class="settings-item__icon"><roc-icon-plus wx:if="{{ag}}" u-i="36599afe-9" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{ag}}"></roc-icon-plus></view><view class="settings-item__content"><text class="settings-item__title">备份全部用户数据</text><text class="settings-item__subtitle">歌单 + 设置</text></view><roc-icon-plus wx:if="{{ah}}" u-i="36599afe-10" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{ah}}"></roc-icon-plus></view></view></view><view class="settings-group"><text class="group-title">恢复数据</text><view class="settings-list"><view class="settings-item" bindtap="{{al}}"><view class="settings-item__icon"><roc-icon-plus wx:if="{{aj}}" u-i="36599afe-11" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{aj}}"></roc-icon-plus></view><view class="settings-item__content"><text class="settings-item__title">恢复用户数据</text><text class="settings-item__subtitle">选择备份文件后自动识别恢复</text></view><roc-icon-plus wx:if="{{ak}}" u-i="36599afe-12" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{ak}}"></roc-icon-plus></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{am}}" class="settings-group"><text class="group-title">备份与恢复记录</text><view class="settings-list"><view wx:for="{{an}}" wx:for-item="item" wx:key="k" class="settings-item history-item"><view class="settings-item__icon"><roc-icon-plus wx:if="{{item.a}}" u-i="{{item.b}}" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{item.c}}"></roc-icon-plus><roc-icon-plus wx:else u-i="{{item.d}}" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{item.e||''}}"></roc-icon-plus></view><view class="settings-item__content"><text class="settings-item__title">{{item.f}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.g}}" class="settings-item__subtitle">{{item.h}}</text><text wx:else class="settings-item__subtitle">{{item.i}}</text><text class="history-item__date">{{item.j}}</text></view></view></view></view></block></scroll-view><view wx:if="{{ao}}" class="freq-modal-overlay" bindtap="{{ay}}"><view class="freq-modal" style="{{aw}}" catchtap="{{ax}}"><view class="freq-modal__header"><text class="freq-modal__title">同步频率</text><view class="freq-modal__close" bindtap="{{aq}}"><roc-icon-plus wx:if="{{ap}}" u-i="36599afe-15" bind:__l="__l" u-p